## Title: |cff66ddffCuriohound|r
## Notes: Tracks the things worth collecting: library books, the Cozy Sleeping Bag, early big bags, perks, companion pets and secrets. Detects what you have finished, tracks every step, and guides you with an on-screen tracker, travel hints (zeppelins, flight masters), and pins on the world map and minimap.
